{"title":"Wilket Creek, Serena Grundy, Sunnybrook, Edwards Garden AND Stretching!","startsAt":"2026-10-11T10:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-11T15:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**MeetUp Point: James for Entrance is off Leslie Street. Turn left on Leslie to Parking Lot 2 in Wilkett Creek Park**\n(Don't follow the pin!)\n\n**Join James for a 12 km hike that is challenging!**\n\nStarting past Wilcott Parking Lot 2, we will be passing through a number of parks and hills.\nFor lunch we can stop at the TBG Bloom cafe for lunch or coffee ---- you might need one; or bring your own lunch.\nWe will finish the hike with much needed yoga streches.\nIt might be muddy, so ensure you have proper footwear!\nAlso layers please, as we are heading into cooler weather!","venue":{"name":"Wilket Creek Park","address":"1120 Leslie St, North York, ON M3C, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.723273,"lng":-79.35078,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"These Boots Are Made for Hiking","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/6/3/c/highres_536229788.jpeg"}